\paragraph{Optimality.} On @@og_areas@@ small areas where every plan with up to two changes can be enumerated,
first-order search found the exact optimum in @@og_first@@, and with exact re-scoring in @@og_polished@@ (median
@@og_sec@@ s). At district scale (Table~\ref{tab:opt}), exact greedy search found the best plan in @@of_greedy@@
districts but took a median @@ob_greedy_sec@@ s. First-order search with re-scoring reached a median
@@ob_polish_share@@ of that score in @@ob_polish_sec@@ s, the speed used in the Studio.

